**Removal is OWED AFTERWARDS and is NOT yours** (never delete): after the verdict Tuesday removes `pc-b1084-node:head`, `pc-b1084-node:final`, `.tools/wt-b1084-{base,fix,mut}`, `.tools/b1084/` and `/tmp/x`. You print the exact names, `docker images` sizes and `du -sk` of the trees in STATUS so the removal is a copy-paste with a size, and say in FOR TUESDAY that it is still owed. You remove ONLY your own `pc-b1101-*` containers, networks and images by exact name, after your logs are saved.

