e commit being squashed). Each checked BY PROGRAM and printed: 0 non-ASCII, 0 `localdomain`, 0 `B[0-9][0-9][0-9]`, 0 `PCOMP-`, 0 `#[0-9]`, 0 person names, lengths, `Co-Authored-By` 1 in `squash-body.txt` and 0 elsewhere, `Generated with` 1 in `pr-body.txt` (controls: planted `B123` reads 1; a planted second trailer reads 2). **The landing rule** (quote it, re-read by `/usr/bin/grep -n -i -F`, control `PR #88`): `1_Project_Definition/CLARIFICATIONS.md:1799` (C-101: "[the coordinator] squash-merges PR #88 pinned to head 2da99cab after re-reading CodeQL and the checks. Nothing is deployed (Composer deploys only on your card).") and `:2032`. Tuesday's command after opening the PR and reading CodeQL green on `refs/pull/<n>/head`: `gh pr merge <n> -R datasecau/Datasec-Security-Composer --squash --match-head-commit 0c10a4dcedaa4bc090a628426668e8f6b6790e30 --subject "$(cat <squash-subject.txt>) (#<n>)" --body-file <squash-body.txt>` (you run none of it).
